# obs-pigreco-racing

Before changing code, read `AGENTS.md` and the relevant `docs/workstreams/*.md`.

## Must

- Follow `STRATEGY.md` tracks; claim a `docs/ROADMAP.md` ID.
- Keep canvas/overlays at **1920×1080**.
- Use brand tokens from `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` (`#00C400`, `#009FE5`, `#080A0C`).
- Extend OBS layouts via `tools/generate_pack.py` (correct `pos_rel`), not fragile hand JSON.
- Sync new config keys to `overlays/config.example.js`.
- Conventional Commits; local git only unless user asks otherwise.
- Preserve `Setup.bat` as the non-technical entry path.

## Must not

- Do not reverse ADRs in `docs/adr/` without a new ADR.
- Do not cover center gameplay with widgets.
- Do not add cloud-only dependencies to the core pack.
- Do not edit `Guida_PiGreco_OBS.pdf` by hand — regenerate with `tools/generate_pdf_guide.py`.
